      "content": "Hey, we've got a situation. A small group of users' emails were exposed because of an S3 bucket misconfiguration that's been sitting open for a few days. The legal team is breathing down my neck, but if this hits the press as a \"security lapse\" or \"human error,\" our brand sentiment scores are going to crater. \n\nHow should we frame this to the press? We need a way to explain the discrepancy without making it look like we lost control of the data.",
